{
    "background_story": "Kylan was a being from a distant planet, belonging to an ancient species known as the Scyphozoa. His people had evolved from a gelatinous, umbrella-like creature that dwelled in the depths of their oceanic homeworld. Over time, they developed advanced technology that allowed them to harness the energy of their surroundings, manipulating the very fabric of space-time. Kylan was a skilled navigator, able to traverse the cosmos with ease. His ship, a massive, translucent vessel, was a marvel of Scyphozoa engineering. As he explored the galaxy, Kylan sought to understand the mysteries of the universe, often forming symbiotic relationships with other intelligent species. His kind had a unique bond with the cosmos, and Kylan's travels helped maintain the balance of the delicate, interconnected web of life that cradled the stars.",
